1000
nd finding common ground in order to get things done.</div><div><br></div><div>I’m proud to have earned a 100% rating from the Sierra Club California last year, and I’m honored to have your organization’s endorsement. My priorities include building green energy infrastructure, safeguarding water, protecting open space, and making corporate polluters pay their fair share.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Prior to my service in the State Assembly, I worked for Fortune 500 companies, nonprofits, and higher-education institutions. I received a B.A. in Political Science from the University of California, Berkeley and a M.A. in International Studies from Claremont Graduate University. I’m a proud mom of two&nbsp; children. I hope to earn your vote.</div></div></div></div></div></div>
