                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Encinitas Union School District Board of Education</p><div>My name is Chris Hargrave and I’m running for Encinitas Union School District Board of Education.&nbsp; I believe all children can achieve with the right support and interventions in place.&nbsp; As a public school teacher, vice principal, principal and researcher, I have dedicated my professional life to strengthening the public school system and consider a high-quality public school education a basic human right for all children.<div><br></div><div>I currently live in Encinitas and all five of my grandchildren attend schools in EUSD.&nbsp; I feel very fortunate to be involved in their daily lives. Which is one of the reasons I’m running for school board.</div><div><br></div><div>Also, I’m running to build on the work that the EUSD board of education has done to support teaching and learning in classrooms with their laser-like focus on student achievement and interventions for students who have not reached grade level standards. Lastly, we need to develop smart evidence-based limits on classroom screen time.</div></div></div></div></div></div>
