                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Mayor of Poway</p><div>As a mother of two, wife to a Navy veteran, and proud homeowner, we’ve rooted our family in Poway. My civic engagement as a community volunteer created the passion I have for protecting Poway. I volunteer in programs like: Poway Historical and Memorial Society, PGSL, PALL baseball, PTA and PUSD District Advisory Committee.<div><br></div><div>I’ll prioritize public health and safety, to address things like the dangers created by the increases in traffic. There’s an imminent need for solar lighted cross-walks, and e-bike regulations. Due to MTS route losses we need to implement a clean air shuttle system, and install more EV charging stations.</div><div><br></div><div>I’ll honor our city motto, “The City in the Country,�
