�� by preserving open spaces while revitalizing wildlife habitats. Re-planting native vegetation and trees, creating sustainable Farm Co-op communities, and enhancing parks by installing accessible playground equipment in all city parks. Working with schools to create a “Cap &amp; Ring Collection” program, which educates families on proper recycling of plastic bottle caps and rings. Incentivizing schools to collect and turn them in, making recycling fun while kids learn to care about the environment in a greatly impactful way.&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Together, we can build an inclusive and prosperous Poway. Your support will make the difference in a brighter future for all. I’m endorsed by the San Diego County Democratic Party.</div></div></div></div></div></div>
